tter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><nav aria-label="breadcrumb"><ol class="breadcrumb"><li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li><li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Blog</li></ol></nav><article><h1 class="mb-4">Aiper Scuba S1 vs Aiper Seagull Pro: Which Aiper Pool Cleaner Should You Buy?</h1><p class="text-muted mb-5">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><div><h2>Quick Verdict</h2><p>The <strong>Aiper Scuba S1</strong> is the better newer choice for most buyers because it offers stronger design refinement and better overall ownership.</p><p>The <strong>Aiper Seagull Pro</strong> can still make sense if pricing is favorable and you want a proven cordless model.</p><h2>At-a-Glance Comparison</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Aiper Scuba S1</th><th>Aiper Seagull Pro</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Design</td><td>Cordless</td><td>Cordless</td></tr><tr><td>Best For</td><td>Most Aiper buyers</td><td>Discount shoppers</td></tr><tr><td>Wall Cleaning</td><td>Good</td><td>Good</td></tr><tr><td>Ease of Use</td><td>Excellent</td><td>Very Good</td></tr><tr><td>Value</td><td>Very Good</td><td>Price dependent</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Cleaning Performance</h2><p>Both models are built around cordless convenience. The Scuba S1 is generally the more current and refined option, while the Seagull Pro may appeal if available at a strong discount.</p><h2>Final Recommendation</h2><p>Choose the <strong>Aiper Scuba S1</strong> unless the Seagull Pro is meaningfully cheaper.</p><h2>Related Resources</h2><ul><li><a href='/reviews/Aiper-Scuba-S1'>Aiper Scuba S1 Review</a></li><li><a href='/reviews/Aiper-Seagull-Pro'>Aiper Seagull Pro Review</a></li><li><a href='/blog/aiper-scuba-s1-vs-beatbot-aquasense-2'>Aiper Scuba S1 vs Beatbot AquaSense 2</a></li></ul><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>Which Aiper model should most people buy?</h3><p>Most buyers should start with the Scuba S1 because it is the more current option.</p><h3>Is the Seagull Pro still worth buying?</h3><p>It can be worth buying if the price is significantly lower.</p></div><div class="mt-5"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/reviews">Find Your Perfect Robot</a></div></div></div></article></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amaz